      <transcript>ZØBSIJERE-</transcript>
      <definition>v.t. and i. To approve, consent, permit, sanction; to surround, go around.</definition>
      <page>1073</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠥᠪᠰᠢᠶᠡᠷᠡᠺᠥ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>--ky ygei</transcript>
          <definition> Not to consent; to refuse , decline.</definition>
        </example>
